                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "hip",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "08114a6f-ac22-37ca-b7d2-6e199a3b67a2",
                                        "entry_id": "dce56160-0d96-3a0d-acc3-40a82e46d5c2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The fruit of a rose."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c87b939-655c-4f75-9ef4-06dce4acb6ef",
                                                "sense_id": "08114a6f-ac22-37ca-b7d2-6e199a3b67a2",
                                                "text": "1. BROTHER. […] What doo you gather there?\nOLD MAN. Hips and Hawes, and stickes and strawes, and thinges that I gather on the ground my sonne."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83aa81e8-ab18-4a59-87fb-7d4845107209",
                                                "sense_id": "08114a6f-ac22-37ca-b7d2-6e199a3b67a2",
                                                "text": "The oaks bear mast, the briars scarlet hips;\nThe bounteous housewife, Nature, on each bush\nLays her full mess before you."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "hip",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9d54930a-63bd-35eb-af93-c3ebc7500d86",
                                        "entry_id": "2f390689-aa23-3ab7-902a-30361b56f64e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Aware, informed, up-to-date, trendy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "123a2eae-8983-45f8-b733-19ffc5dc3a2b",
                                                "sense_id": "9d54930a-63bd-35eb-af93-c3ebc7500d86",
                                                "text": "I am also starting a folk-entourage school where you can go into gladitorial training to hang out in hip crowds with budding young folk stars."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68345e91-25ba-4176-8125-5ff4f1e079cc",
                                                "sense_id": "9d54930a-63bd-35eb-af93-c3ebc7500d86",
                                                "text": "Everybody's saying that / Hell's the hippest way to go / Well, I don't think so / But I'm gonna take a look around it, though"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4666eb95-cef8-42d4-bd4f-c3ee34988412",
                                                "sense_id": "9d54930a-63bd-35eb-af93-c3ebc7500d86",
                                                "text": "“Saturday Night” has an explicitly hip, cynical outlook, coupled with an impressive amount of freedom."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6dfe049a-fbf5-49d6-a5c0-41e6eac3bce4",
                                                "sense_id": "9d54930a-63bd-35eb-af93-c3ebc7500d86",
                                                "text": "One of the saints in my life is this woman named Imogene Hill, who was a fourth-grade teacher who taught this advanced class. She got hip to my whole situation in about a month and kindled a passion in me for learning things."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "035d4b86-624f-4a4e-9c00-6d98edaef9c9",
                                                "sense_id": "9d54930a-63bd-35eb-af93-c3ebc7500d86",
                                                "text": "Rudolph promoted Stevens Pass with restless zeal. In seven years there, he helped turn a relatively small, roadside ski area into a hip destination."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "hip",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "20a9df43-dcea-319a-b816-1af21e80d586",
                                        "entry_id": "a5dfb804-0801-3b06-bcd6-597d1a5d40a1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To inform, to make knowledgeable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "652ddcd6-ea99-4378-bbe2-4d3ed04da837",
                                                "sense_id": "20a9df43-dcea-319a-b816-1af21e80d586",
                                                "text": "No doubt, too, Sand must have hipped him quietly in a whisper somewhere what was happening with the lover"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5f3a4ef-4081-4075-8237-171064cdeece",
                                                "sense_id": "20a9df43-dcea-319a-b816-1af21e80d586",
                                                "text": "She's a volunteer, hipped on civil rights, another do-gooder, evidently with a private pile since she takes no pay"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "774da5ab-3a8f-4110-b1be-9c0c18fc9fe0",
                                                "sense_id": "20a9df43-dcea-319a-b816-1af21e80d586",
                                                "text": "She went ape over Chris. She'd go downtown and come home with shopping bags loaded with fine dresses and underclothes for herself and her sisters. Later she hipped Chris to boosting"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "342b93fa-9f14-4836-99e9-a29465f7fc99",
                                                "sense_id": "20a9df43-dcea-319a-b816-1af21e80d586",
                                                "text": "A friend just hipped me to your rag and its ^([sic]) been a totally beautiful experience! Presently I'm imprisoned at the California Institute for Women and would like to receive my own issues of GCN."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "324175ab-96cd-48b0-bcbc-5ba029511c4c",
                                                "sense_id": "20a9df43-dcea-319a-b816-1af21e80d586",
                                                "text": "The guy hips himself to so many things."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
